        <mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;Tutorial&amp;nbsp;16.1&lt;/b&gt; The five flag counts, the entries and their amounts at each risk score, the eight entries that score 2 or more, the entries by year and by approver, the ledger lines of the top entry, and Test 1" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F6F3;strokeColor=#117A65;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="40" width="352" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;44&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;rows" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#117A65;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="356" y="40" width="66" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;Tutorial&amp;nbsp;16.2&lt;/b&gt; The flags of the orders and registers, the register&#x27;s rows and their keys, each test&#x27;s exceptions and rate per 1,000, every month&#x27;s count, the approvers, and the exceptions and rates of each process and year" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F6F3;strokeColor=#117A65;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="126" width="352" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
